# Deliberately fake credential, randomly generated and not tied to any
# real account. Used only by .github/workflows/test-security-scan.yml to
# prove Trivy still detects secrets after a version bump.
#
# Deliberately NOT using a well-known published placeholder like AWS's
# doc example key (AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE) - Trivy specifically allow-lists
